<section id="purchases"><h2>Purchases and prints</h2>
<p>Prices are in US dollars. Shipping and applicable tax are shown before payment. An order is accepted when payment is confirmed. Payments are handled by the payment provider shown at checkout, under its own terms; this site does not store full card numbers.</p>
<p>Original paintings are one of a kind and are reserved for you only while checkout is in progress. Fine-art prints are made to order and produced and shipped by a print partner. Dispatch times, delivery, and damage support are described in <a href="/shipping-returns/">Shipping &amp; returns</a>.</p>
