<p>A commission starts with a 50% deposit. The size, subject, price, timing, approval stages, and cancellation terms are agreed with you in writing before work begins, and the balance is due on completion as agreed. Reference photos you provide are handled as described in the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a>. You confirm you have the right to share them.</p>
